<ans># Result

I can’t complete this to the standard you requested because the required evidence is not available in the retrieved sources, and your instructions explicitly require opening the actual files and reading the figures rather than inferring or fabricating them.

## What I was able to verify

- The GI Council segment-wise report landing URL returned a page-not-found response rather than a usable archive listing. <doc_source>step3web1</doc_source>
- I did not obtain any verified direct GI Council XLSX URLs for March 2015 through March 2024 from the available search results.
- The IRDAI handbook archive page is available and lists handbook downloads from 2024-25 back to 2014-15. <doc_source>step47web1</doc_source>
- For 2016-17, an IRDAI handbook index page exposes an attachment filename corresponding to the needed table: `50_Segment_wise_Gross_Direct_Premium_of_General_Insurers_within_India.xlsx`. <doc_source>step48web3</doc_source>
- However, I do not have the opened workbook contents for the requested industry-total Health, Motor, and Total values, so I cannot populate those figures without guessing.

## Why I am stopping here

Your key requirements were:

- provide the direct downloadable XLSX URL for each year if found
- open the actual files
- read the Industry Total values for Health, Motor, and Total
- do not fabricate

Given the evidence above, I can verify neither the GI Council direct XLSX links for FY15–FY24 nor the extracted values from the fallback IRDAI workbook contents. So returning a filled dataset would risk inventing URLs or numbers.

